      "widgets_values": [
        "Image 2 shows the art style only. A single wide rectangular game menu button seen straight on, centred: a bevelled gunmetal plate with a thin amber-gold edge light and an empty middle for a label, no text, as pixel art game UI in image 2's Neo-Terra sci-fi style: dark riveted gunmetal panels with amber-gold accents, like the frames, headers and title on image 2, clean dark outlines, light from the top left, crisp 16-bit pixels, flat colours, no blur. Flat solid magenta background (#FF00FF) around it, no other objects, no shadows.",
